---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — SCRITSHELL"
  description="Learn more about Scritshell, a software and web developer based in Almería, Spain."
>
  <section class="standard-page" aria-labelledby="page-title">
    <p class="section-index">02 · ABOUT</p>

    <h1 id="page-title">A little more about me.</h1>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Who I am</h2>

      <p class="page-lede">
        I'm Scritshell! I'm a software and web developer, currently 20 years old
        and based in Almería, Spain. I mainly speak Spanish, Romanian and English.
      </p>

      <p>
        SCRITSHELL is a nickname I came up with almost a decade ago, when I was
        still a kid. There's no particular meaning behind it.
        This website was born from the idea of having my own little corner of 
        the internet where I can share my ideas, interests, projects and thoughts.
      </p>

      <h2>What I do</h2>

      <p>
        Here you'll find projects of many different kinds. I tend to explore
        whatever new thing catches my attention and try to give it some kind of
        digital life. I've worked with Windows 11 and several Linux
        distributions (Arch, Ubuntu and Kali), and
        experimented with technologies such as Java, Python, C# for Unity,
        Kotlin, XML, HTML, CSS, JavaScript and TypeScript. Most of the time, I
        simply enjoy experimenting and seeing where an idea takes me.
      </p>

      <h2>Beyond the code</h2>

      <p>
        I'm fascinated by rhythm games, and I spend quite a bit of my free time
        working on and experimenting with projects related to them. I also
        really love animals, especially cats.
      </p>

      <p>
        The visual identity of this website comes from two things I really
        enjoy: rhythm and the cosmos. I've always had a strong interest in
        astronomy, so it felt natural to bring that into the design.
      </p>

      <h2>Where I'm heading</h2>

      <p>
        I'm still teaching myself and learning with every new thing I build.
        Recently, I've also started getting into cybersecurity and studying it
        in my free time.
      </p>

      <p>
        I'm also learning FL Studio with the idea of eventually composing my own
        music, just as another hobby to explore.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>